{"book":11,"chapter":16,"rubric":"MODERN FRONTEND / CSS AND LAYOUT","slides":[{"title":"The CSS rule","sub":"Selector and declarations","main":"Rule = selector (\"what to style\") + \"property: value\" declarations (\"what to do\").","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Rule","Selector","Declarations","Pair"],"captions":["A CSS rule is a selector and a block in curly braces","The selector answers \"which elements\": here, all top-level headings","Declarations answer \"what to do with them\": color and font size","A declaration is a \"property: value\" pair; we describe the result, not the steps"],"frames":[[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":14.0,"y":40.0,"lines":["h1 {","  color: navy;","  font-size: 2rem;","}"],"lang":"css","size":11.0,"lh":18.0,"w":150.0},{"t":"text","id":"n","x":270.0,"y":85.0,"text":"rule","size":12.0}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":14.0,"y":40.0,"lines":["h1 {","  color: navy;","  font-size: 2rem;","}"],"hl":[0],"lang":"css","size":11.0,"lh":18.0,"w":150.0},{"t":"cell","id":"s","x":270.0,"y":40.0,"w":130.0,"h":30.0,"text":"selector:\nwhich elements","tone":"blue","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"a","x1":168.0,"y1":36.0,"x2":203.0,"y2":38.0,"tone":"blue","arrow":true,"width":1.6}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":14.0,"y":40.0,"lines":["h1 {","  color: navy;","  font-size: 2rem;","}"],"hl":[1,2],"lang":"css","size":11.0,"lh":18.0,"w":150.0},{"t":"cell","id":"d","x":270.0,"y":85.0,"w":130.0,"h":30.0,"text":"declarations:\nwhat to do","tone":"green","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"a","x1":168.0,"y1":68.0,"x2":203.0,"y2":80.0,"tone":"green","arrow":true,"width":1.6}],[{"t":"cell","id":"p","x":85.0,"y":70.0,"w":100.0,"h":28.0,"text":"font-size","tone":"yellow","size":10.0,"sub":"property","sub_size":8.5},{"t":"text","id":"k","x":147.0,"y":74.0,"text":":","size":14.0},{"t":"cell","id":"v","x":210.0,"y":70.0,"w":80.0,"h":28.0,"text":"2rem","tone":"yellow","size":10.0,"sub":"value","sub_size":8.5},{"t":"text","id":"n","x":180.0,"y":140.0,"text":"declarative: we say what we want","size":10.0}]],"cues":[8.9,15.6,25.4]}]},{"title":"Attaching styles","sub":"link, style, style attribute","main":"Styles come as a file, a block or an attribute; a stylesheet blocks rendering.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["link","style","style attribute","Blocking"],"captions":["The main way is a link element to a separate file: the browser caches it, all pages share it","The style element puts rules right in the document: for small pages and the most critical styles","The style attribute affects one element: for tests and values computed by a script","Until the stylesheet is loaded and parsed, the browser draws nothing: it blocks rendering"],"frames":[[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":14.0,"y":38.0,"lines":["<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"app.css\">"],"lang":"html","size":10.0,"lh":13.0,"w":250.0},{"t":"line","id":"a","x1":180.0,"y1":56.0,"x2":180.0,"y2":92.0,"tone":"green","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"cell","id":"f","x":180.0,"y":112.0,"w":130.0,"h":30.0,"text":"app.css","tone":"green","size":10.0,"sub":"cache shared by pages","sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":14.0,"y":38.0,"lines":["<style>","  p { color: red; }","</style>"],"lang":"html","size":10.0,"lh":15.0,"w":150.0},{"t":"cell","id":"f","x":270.0,"y":54.0,"w":130.0,"h":30.0,"text":"rules inside\nthe document","tone":"blue","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"text","id":"n","x":180.0,"y":140.0,"text":"handy for small pages and the first screen","size":10.0}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":14.0,"y":44.0,"lines":["<p style=\"color: red\">Text</p>"],"lang":"html","size":10.0,"lh":13.0,"w":220.0},{"t":"cell","id":"f","x":180.0,"y":96.0,"w":220.0,"h":28.0,"text":"affects one element","tone":"yellow","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"text","id":"n","x":180.0,"y":140.0,"text":"for tests and script values","size":10.0}],[{"t":"cell","id":"h","x":55.0,"y":70.0,"w":80.0,"h":30.0,"text":"HTML","tone":"green","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"a1","x1":97.0,"y1":70.0,"x2":118.0,"y2":